# ovh_vps (Data Source)

Use this data source to retrieve information about a VPS.

The attributes at the root hold the settings you requested for the VPS, and `current_state` holds what the VPS currently runs.

-> **NOTE** The schema of this data source changed in version 3.0.0 of the provider. See the [VPS migration guide](../guides/vps_migration) to update a configuration written for a previous version.

